    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>With the help of the Elementor Cafe &amp; Restaurant WhatsApp Menu addon, you can add an attractive food menu with WhatsApp ordering capability to your website.</p>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"https://arzwp.shop/whatsapp-food-menu-addon-for-elementor/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></p>\n<p>🗝️ Pro Version Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Unlock Customizing Styles Of Menu</strong> <a href=\"https://arzwp.shop/whatsapp-food-menu-addon-for-elementor/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PRO</a> </li>\n<li><strong>Unlock Multiple Whatsapp Account</strong> [PRO] </li>\n<li><strong>Unlock Managing &#8220;Open/Closed&#8221; Store Status</strong> [PRO]</li>\n<li><strong>RTL Support</strong> [PRO]</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>You can type “WhatsApp Food Menu” on your Element tabs within the Elementor editor, and the element will appear.</li>\n<li>Also, you can see the element under the category “WhatsApp Food Menu” on your element/widget list.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>v1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>v1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix readme file</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
